{
    "title": "Photo Collage Maker - FunPic",
    "description": "Explore your photo journey anytime, anywhere with <b>Pic Collage Maker & Photo Editor - FunPic</b>!\r\n\r\nCombine photos into stunning collages, tell your story, and let your imagination shine through. Whether you're a newbie or a pro, FunPic photo editor is perfect for turning your precious memories into works of art. Customize your moments with <b>diverse layouts, stickers, templates, filters, brushes & texts</b>. Elevate creativity with our  <b>hands-free AI background eraser & changer</b>. Embark on an incredibly fun & easy journey now!\r\n\r\n\u2728 <b>Rich Materials for Every Style</b>\r\n\u25cf Access 300+ layouts to effortlessly arrange your photos.\r\n\u25cf Choose from 1000+ stickers & backgrounds to embellish your collages.\r\n\u25cf Explore themed templates fit for every occasion: Love, Birthday, Festival\u2026\r\n\u25cf Add text to convey messages that perfectly complement your photo collage.\r\n\u25cf Apply artistic filters to enhance the mood of your photos.\r\n\u25cf Adjust the ratio to 1:1, 4:5\u2026, perfectly suited for Instagram, WhatsApp\u2026\r\n\u25cf Doodle to add personalized drawings & artistic touches to your photos.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfac <b>Photo Slideshow Maker</b>  \r\nCraft captivating photo slideshows with popular music, seamless transitions, animation stickers and text. Merge your cherished moments - birthdays, travels, or any special event - into stunning videos effortlessly.  \r\n- Trendy free music from instrumental to upbeat.  \r\n- Choose from 500+ backgrounds or simply blur them.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <b>Collage Your Life</b>\r\nOur powerful collage maker allows you seamlessly merge your favorite moments, making the photo tell your story and journal your life. \r\n- Combine up to 18 photos into captivating picture collages.\r\n- Choose from a variety of grid layout, standard or special-shaped, always one for you.\r\n- Adjust the border & spacing of each photo to achieve the desired arrangement.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccc <b>Pin Memorable Moments</b>\r\nTry freestyle feature to get complete freedom for making collages. Break free from the traditional grid-based layouts and engage your imagination.\r\n- Drag & drop photos anywhere on the canvas.\r\n- Resize, rotate & crop photos to achieve the desired visual effect.\r\n- Experiment with various backgrounds and stickers to enhance your picture collage.\r\n\r\n\u2702\ufe0f <b>Auto Remove Background</b> \r\nAI background eraser & photo editor are designed to help you remove background automatically and replace it in one tap. \r\n- Utilize advanced AI to automatically remove background.\r\n- Refine edges and make precise adjustments to ensure seamless integration.\r\n- Choose from a variety of replacement backgrounds or add your own backdrop.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7 <b>Edit Photo With Ease</b>\r\nPhoto Editor & Pic Collage Maker goes beyond collage creation, offering a comprehensive suite of photo editing tools. \r\n- Apply artistic filters, stickers and text to add a touch of magic.\r\n- Experience unique blur effects to keep anything you want in focus.\r\n- Crop & rotate your photos to achieve the ideal composition.\r\n\r\nGet Pic Collage Maker & Photo Editor now to unlock a world of endless creativity. Turn your photos into captivating collages, express your unique style, and share it with the world. We\u2019re trying to make FunPic your only pic collage maker, so if you have any problems or suggestions, feel free to let us know. Email: fotogrid.apps@gmail.com\r\n\r\n- Terms of Use: https://hardstonepte.ltd/terms_of_use.html\r\n- Privacy Policy: https://hardstonepte.ltd/funpic/policy.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Explore your photo journey anytime, anywhere with <b>Pic Collage Maker &amp; Photo Editor - FunPic</b>!<br><br>Combine photos into stunning collages, tell your story, and let your imagination shine through. Whether you&#39;re a newbie or a pro, FunPic photo editor is perfect for turning your precious memories into works of art. Customize your moments with <b>diverse layouts, stickers, templates, filters, brushes &amp; texts</b>. Elevate creativity with our  <b>hands-free AI background eraser &amp; changer</b>. Embark on an incredibly fun &amp; easy journey now!<br><br>\u2728 <b>Rich Materials for Every Style</b><br>\u25cf Access 300+ layouts to effortlessly arrange your photos.<br>\u25cf Choose from 1000+ stickers &amp; backgrounds to embellish your collages.<br>\u25cf Explore themed templates fit for every occasion: Love, Birthday, Festival\u2026<br>\u25cf Add text to convey messages that perfectly complement your photo collage.<br>\u25cf Apply artistic filters to enhance the mood of your photos.<br>\u25cf Adjust the ratio to 1:1, 4:5\u2026, perfectly suited for Instagram, WhatsApp\u2026<br>\u25cf Doodle to add personalized drawings &amp; artistic touches to your photos.<br><br>\ud83c\udfac <b>Photo Slideshow Maker</b>  <br>Craft captivating photo slideshows with popular music, seamless transitions, animation stickers and text. Merge your cherished moments - birthdays, travels, or any special event - into stunning videos effortlessly.  <br>- Trendy free music from instrumental to upbeat.  <br>- Choose from 500+ backgrounds or simply blur them.<br><br>\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <b>Collage Your Life</b><br>Our powerful collage maker allows you seamlessly merge your favorite moments, making the photo tell your story and journal your life. <br>- Combine up to 18 photos into captivating picture collages.<br>- Choose from a variety of grid layout, standard or special-shaped, always one for you.<br>- Adjust the border &amp; spacing of each photo to achieve the desired arrangement.<br><br>\ud83d\udccc <b>Pin Memorable Moments</b><br>Try freestyle feature to get complete freedom for making collages. Break free from the traditional grid-based layouts and engage your imagination.<br>- Drag &amp; drop photos anywhere on the canvas.<br>- Resize, rotate &amp; crop photos to achieve the desired visual effect.<br>- Experiment with various backgrounds and stickers to enhance your picture collage.<br><br>\u2702\ufe0f <b>Auto Remove Background</b> <br>AI background eraser &amp; photo editor are designed to help you remove background automatically and replace it in one tap. <br>- Utilize advanced AI to automatically remove background.<br>- Refine edges and make precise adjustments to ensure seamless integration.<br>- Choose from a variety of replacement backgrounds or add your own backdrop.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf7 <b>Edit Photo With Ease</b><br>Photo Editor &amp; Pic Collage Maker goes beyond collage creation, offering a comprehensive suite of photo editing tools. <br>- Apply artistic filters, stickers and text to add a touch of magic.<br>- Experience unique blur effects to keep anything you want in focus.<br>- Crop &amp; rotate your photos to achieve the ideal composition.<br><br>Get Pic Collage Maker &amp; Photo Editor now to unlock a world of endless creativity. Turn your photos into captivating collages, express your unique style, and share it with the world. We\u2019re trying to make FunPic your only pic collage maker, so if you have any problems or suggestions, feel free to let us know. Email: fotogrid.apps@gmail.com<br><br>- Terms of Use: https://hardstonepte.ltd/terms_of_use.html<br>- Privacy Policy: https://hardstonepte.ltd/funpic/policy.html",
